{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnparser"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNParser","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"A-parsed-score-is-less-typed-than-a-normalized-one","text":"A parsed score is less typed than a normalized one","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser promotes a tag to a typed "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag"},{"type":"text","text":" case only when what was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written binds cleanly: a name GMN reserves, every parameter one the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tag accepts, every value of the declared type. It never repairs and never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discards, so anything else arrives intact on one of the two untyped lanes:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an alias such as "},{"code":"\\bm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a deprecated parameter name, or a value of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrong type lands on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", since the name is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved, and a name GMN does not reserve lands on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text",